  "issue": {
    "body": "It's not a bug with Starlette itself but I think it's the best way to let you know about the problem.\r\n\r\n1. When you google `starlette exceptions` the first result is [https://www.starlette.io/exceptions/](https://www.starlette.io/exceptions/) which 404s. The correct URL would be [https://www.starlette.io/exceptions.html](https://www.starlette.io/exceptions.html).\r\n2. Broken sitemap. `loc` is empty.\r\n```\r\n<url>\r\n<loc>None</loc>\r\n<lastmod>2021-06-23</lastmod>\r\n<changefreq>daily</changefreq>\r\n</url>\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. No proper HTTP -> HTTPS redirection.  http://starlette.io/ doesn't work.\r\n\r\n\r\nThese 3 issues combined make it more difficult to find proper sections of your docs using search engines.",
    "closed_at": "2021-06-25T07:46:38Z",
